Really? Apart from the fact that IE5 is I believe currently
on just one platform, have you tried _all_ the PDF viewers?
I much prefer Acrobat 4, for example. And although I don't think
I want users editing my manuals, Acrobat allows readers to add
notes to the files (and indeed, PDF files are user-editable
