We have an implementation of the noncentral t in both Fortran and C
(C translated from Fortran by Promula) in the library dcdflib.
Calculations for the cdf, inverse, and more are available.

The method   is  a  double   series  taken  from  Johnson,  Kotz   and
Balakrishman (1995) Continuous Univariate Distributions, Vol 2, Second
Edition, Wiley.

