Automation chapter in the programmer's guide and there are sample VB 
programs in $SHOME/samples. Everything I have done is modelled on those 
samples. Here's an example:
Sub Macro1()
'
Set SplusApplication = GetObject("", "S-PLUS.Application") 
SplusApplication.ExecuteString "myfun <- function(x) {x^2}" 
SplusApplication.ExecuteString "register.ole.object(""myfun"")" 
Set myVBfun = CreateObject("S-PLUS.myfun") 
myVBfun.SetParameterClasses ("vector,vector")
myVBfun.x = 10
myVBfun.Run
Range("A1").Select
ActiveCell.FormulaR1C1 = myVBfun.ReturnValue 
'
End Sub
