From rolf at maths.uwa.edu.au  Thu May  6 02:13:45 1999
From: rolf at maths.uwa.edu.au (Rolf Turner)
Date: Thu, 06 May 1999 10:13:45 +0800
Subject: Re: [S] GUI Graphs
In-Reply-To: <Pine.GSO.4.10.9905051603410.2830-100000@ev.nssl.noaa.gov>
