Subject: [S] Adobe 4.0 options for converting S-Plus postscript
Message-ID: <0EB7D2C228BCD21181BA00805F8549EA37F497@intmail.cap.org>

To convert S-Plus postscript files to pdf using Distiller 4.0, you need to
create a new Job Options category.  Under Settings - Job Options - Advanced,
turn off the Process DSC Comments and save this set of options.

Distiller 3.01 ignored the comments, but version 4.0 tries to process them.
In its translation, it distills the lower-left corner of the ps file.  When
you turn them off, it works fine.

I hope this helps some of you.

